    "No IV-reference AUC comparison for the query.",
    "No query-specific solubility or permeability measurement; C120 is for linezolid, a close structural analog, not the query itself.",
    "L4 records are absorption-component assays, not direct systemic-F measurements."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "Prediction remains high: all visible L1 gold records report F >20%, L3 oral exposure records for related oxazolidinones show substantial oral systemic exposure, and L4 Caco-2 permeability for linezolid (PNU-100766) is high, supporting favorable intestinal absorption for the oxazolidinone scaffold. No affirmative evidence indicates F <20% for the query under fed conditions. Confidence remains moderate because direct query-specific fed-state F data are lacking."
}

